1531	// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
1532	// verify: member names are recognized by their JSON-decoded text
1533	//
1534	// An external program that saves or re-formats a record may spell a member
1535	// name with \u escapes; the name is recognized by its decoded text, so the
1536	// rewrite stays valid. The same decoding rule makes two spellings of one
1537	// decoded name a duplicate member (exit 2), and never promotes a look-alike
1538	// name (different case, surrounding whitespace, extra characters) into a
1539	// known member.
